Package: delphyrApp
Title: Trilingual 'shiny' Workflows for Delphi Studies
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("R.", "Heller", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"), email = "raban.heller@uni-ulm.de",
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-8006-9742"))
Description: Provides an English, French and German 'shiny' interface for
    round-based Delphi studies that uses the transactional services of
    'delphyr'. Panel, study-management and editorial workflows give explicit
    save and submission receipts. The bundled examples use synthetic studies
    only; production authentication and deployment remain acceptance gates.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Language: en-US
SystemRequirements: PostgreSQL (tested with version 17) for running
    studies.
Imports: DBI, shiny, bslib, delphyr (>= 0.1.0), htmltools, jsonlite (>= 1.8.8), uuid, zip
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), knitr, rmarkdown, withr
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://github.com/CTTIR/delphyR
BugReports: https://github.com/CTTIR/delphyR/issues
Config/Needs/website: CTTIR/themakR, pkgdown
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
